特征、脸谱含义以及象征组合。","title":"评剧的形成与代表剧目","content":"评剧在清末河北滦县的对口莲花落基础上形成，后来进入唐山并称唐山落子，代表剧目有《花为媒》《杨三姐告状》。","label":"评剧的形成与代表剧目","note":"评剧在清末河北滦县的对口莲花落基础上形成，后来进入唐山并称唐山落子，代表剧目有《花为媒》《杨三姐告状》。","learningGoal":"说明评剧的形成地区、早期称谓和代表剧目。","productionMode":"light-edit","productionLabel":"轻度整理","semanticRevision":1,"pointId":"traditional-arts","tabId":"traditional-opera","sourceUnitIds":["cs-10-15-p18-opera-table"],"sourceUrl":"/subpackages/common-sense/detail/index?moduleId=common-sense&pointId=traditional-arts&tabId=traditional-opera","mapping":"source-overlap","review":{"admission":"expansion-candidate","sourceFidelity":"self-reviewed","noviceReadability":"pending-user-sampling","independentFactReview":"pending-independent-review"},"signature":"be373f7c","learningSignature":"f653ff36"}]